    "1": {
      "note": "<em>cin2</em> (錢, money) is the base; specific contexts build on it. <strong>zaau2 cin2</strong> (找錢) is the change you get back at a shop. <strong>saan3 zi2</strong> (散紙) means coins or small notes — you'll be asked <em>jau5 mou5 saan3 zi2?</em> when paying. <strong>tai4 fun2 gei1</strong> (提款機) is an ATM, literally 'withdraw money machine'. <strong>ngan4 hong4</strong> (銀行) is bank, literally 'silver firm' — silver being the historical currency.",
